ne captured","command_ids":["cmd-9130bbee27eb4e45"],"summary":"Captured boot_id 39963d5e-3c5d-43ff-a9db-4c55e289497e, confirmed sudoers.d config present, log file present with correct permissions, syslog service running"},{"requirement":"node1 restart acknowledged, executed one node at a time","command_ids":["cmd-d9e2d53d68cd4ea1"],"summary":"Backgrounded 'sleep 1; reboot' command returned ack (pid=2866) before the node disconnected"},{"requirement":"Node1 boot identity changed, proving actual restart","command_ids":["cmd-607e9e23dc2f4cbf","cmd-4e084b42311b4efe"],"summary":"exec calls failed with connection errors while node1 was down, then succeeded again reporting boot_id 16b634f5-181f-4998-9fab-a484db66fc1d, differing from the pre-restart boot_id, proving a genuine kernel restart"},{"requirement":"Post-restart recovery of sudo logging configuration and functional verification","command_ids":["cmd-91e03b7d17254e1e"],"summary":"After reboot: sudoers.d/00-sudo-logging content intact and visudo -c parses OK, syslogd service still started, new sudo commands (whoami, hostname) appended correctly to /var/log/sudo-commands.log while /var/log/messages showed no new sudo entries beyond the original pre-change baseline"}]},"ttft_ms":2118,"type":"result","duration_ms":87494,"uuid":"52f07800-413e-4ff3-a341-90625b126e00","ttft_stream_ms":1198,"time_to_request_ms":84,"first_content_frame_ms":1198,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
